Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs20\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(90.133,249.6)}⌈Earth is Great, datsun!⌉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice weather again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth is the beeeeeeeeest!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Days like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,really make me glad we came to Earth, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a feeling only aliens like us would understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I should head to work soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at the zoo right now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Squids are so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use your shapeshifting to work all kinds of places.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, pandas pay really well per hour right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I just can't get used to eating bamboo leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, even slathering them in mayo doesn't help much, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, why do aliens like us have to work anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a time when just being an alien made good money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When we first got to Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,we made serious cash just sending our photos to magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nowadays, photos of us aliens aren't worth a single cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.27,0:01:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just become a casual part of daily life now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.31,0:01:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We messed up our integration strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The other day, I went directly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to Mu's editorial office or whatever magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they kicked me out just because \NI didn't have an appointment!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Aliens don't make appointments!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not making appointments is what makes us aliens, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"We're visiting Earth next week..."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.74,0:01:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where in the world is a UFO that makes an \Nappointment before landing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Though for part-time job interviews, \Nwe make sure to schedule appointments properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.31,0:01:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Classic alien move!\NHahaha!
